I found a couple of good and bad things about Nethack 3.1

The good thing is that shops seem to be more frequent.  Also, there seem
to be more goodies in them.  All I know is that I've never found a good
artifact in a shop and today I found Frost Brand in 3.1.  Although it was
cursed, can you think of anything better to have stuck to your hand?
(No comments please.)

Anyway, it was cursed so my cat would not steal it.  I (being a wizard)
started with a wand of digging.  So I though, what the hell, I'll dig a
whole and and tunnel down to the next level.  So I grabbed all of the
goodies from the shop, including: A crystal plate mail, gauntlets of
power, and lev. boots.

I escaped, and was promptly zapped with a sleep wand and rubber-clubbed
to death by a keystone cop.

Next time, maybe.


